"targetText":"日居月諸，照臨下土。乃如之人兮，逝不古處。胡能有定，寧不我顧。","targetNotes":"首章。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应维基文库《詩經集傳/卷之二》日月首章。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"朱熹","sectionLabel":null}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":5,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"日居月諸，下土是冒。乃如之人兮，逝不相好。胡能有定，寧不我報。","targetNotes":"第二章。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应维基文库《詩經集傳/卷之二》日月第二章。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"朱熹","sectionLabel":null}]},{"id":"0003","order":3,"total":5,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"日居月諸，出自東方。乃如之人兮，德音無良。胡能有定，俾也可忘。","targetNotes":"第三章。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应维基文库《詩經集傳/卷之二》日月第三章。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0003-1","attributionLabel":"朱熹","sectionLabel":null}]},{"id":"0004","order":4,"total":5,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"日居月諸，東方自出。父兮母兮，畜我不卒。胡能有定，報我不述。","targetNotes":"第四章。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应维基文库《詩經集傳/卷之二》日月第四章。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0004-1","attributionLabel":"朱熹","sectionLabel":null}]},{"id":"0005","order":5,"total":5,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"日月四章章六句","targetNotes":"章句总说。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应维基文库《詩經集傳/卷之二》日月章句总说。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0005-1","attributionLabel":"朱熹","sectionLabel":null}]}]}}}
